    "html":  "\u003cdiv class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan typeof=\"mw:File\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2b/Reuela_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20230804125448\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Reuela Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/2/2b/Reuela_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20230804125448\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"943\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Reuela Queen\u0026#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Reuela_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eSwordman of Redemption\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA Beautiful Warrior with a cursed great sword said to have been to commit numerous crimes.\nShe, too has been cursed by the sword, but unlike its former owners,who were consumed by its power, she embarks in a journey of redemption to lift the curse.\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260820202938\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n--\u003e\n\u003c!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n--\u003e\n\n\u003c!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39662-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 202608